Package: ictools
Title: Unified Tools for Classical and Bootstrap Confidence Intervals
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Rayan", "Siffe", 
           email = "bydex859@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Rayan Siffe <bydex859@gmail.com>
Description: Provides a unified and consistent interface for computing 
    classical and bootstrap confidence intervals for means, variances, 
    proportions, variance ratios, and regression coefficients. The package 
    offers a standardized output structure, S3 classes, and user-friendly 
    methods to facilitate statistical analysis and reproducibility.
